        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">"Will I run into someone I know?"</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Famagusta is a small place. This is one of the questions we are asked most, and it is a fair one. It is among the main reasons people put off starting.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Appointments are arranged with that in mind. Sessions and your personal information are protected in line with confidentiality principles; what you say stays between you and your psychologist.</p>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">If coming to the centre is still difficult, online sessions are an option — the same psychologist, the same length, from home.</p>
      </div>
